{title: 245 - More About Jesus}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #245 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 245}
{meta: category Jesus Christ - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]More about Jesus, I would know, More of His grace [D]to others show;
[D/F#]More [G]of His saving fullness [Bm]see, More [G]of His love who [Em]died for me.
[G]More, more about Jesus, More, more about Jesus;
[G/D]More of His [D]saving fullness see, More of [G]His love who died for me.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[G]More, [Bm]more about [G]Jesus,
[G]More, more about [Em]Jesus;
[G]More of His saving fullness see,
[G]More of His love who died for me.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G]More about Jesus, let [D]me learn,
[D/F#]More [G]of His [Bm]holy [G]will discern;
[G]Spirit of God, my teacher be,
[G/D]Showing [D]the things of [G]Christ to me.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[G]More about Jesus, in [D]His word,
[D/F#]Holding [G]communion with my [Em]Lord;
[G]Hearing His voice in every line,
[G/D]Making [D/F#]each faithful [G]saying mine.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[G]More about Jesus, on [D]His throne,
[D/F#]Riches [G]in [Bm]glory [G]all His [Em]own;
[G]More of His kingdom's sure increase,
[G/D]More of [D]His coming, [G]Prince of Peace.
{end_of_verse}
